  partName: IntakeManifoldBoltCenterLeft (2)
  description: The IntakeManifoldBoltCenterLeft (2) is another tiny, elongated bolt
    situated at the top-left-center of the engine, working alongside the IntakeManifoldBoltCenterLeft
    to secure the intake manifold in place. Made of Material.001, this bolt is designed
    to withstand the stresses and temperatures generated by the engine's intake system.
    Interestingly, the IntakeManifoldBoltCenterLeft (2) is positioned to provide
    additional support to the intake manifold, helping to prevent damage and vibration.
